If you still have your wand of wishing, keep zapping it until you wrest
an extra charge out of it.  Then wish for a scroll of teleportation and
if you have teleport control, choose level 50.  You may have to zap the
wand up to a hundred times (or more) as there is a small random chance
each time you try that you will get the extra wish.  Make sure your luck
is not low or you will not get the extra wish.


